10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001	organization.read	Read Organization	View basic organization information
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	membership.read	Read Memberships	View organization members, roles, and reporting relationships permitted by visibility rules
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003	invitation.create	Create Invitation	Create an invitation for an allowed role and reporting assignment
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004	invitation.revoke	Revoke Invitation	Revoke an invitation within permitted scope
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005	membership.update	Update Membership	Change a membership role or valid reporting assignment within permitted scope
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006	membership.remove	Remove Membership	Remove a membership within permitted scope
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007	organization.manage	Manage Organization	Update organization settings and transfer ownership
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008	audit_log.read	Read Audit Logs	View organization audit events when authorized
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009	session.manage_self	Manage Own Sessions	View and revoke the actor's own sessions
10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010	session.manage_any	Manage Any Session	Revoke another user's sessions when that user is within the actor's permitted scope
\.
